### Page 1 of 1

```text
Steil
Surveying
Services
Professional Land Surveyors & Development Specialists
November 20, 2017
TO:
Eric Hammer, City of Cheyenne Development Office
InRe: POSTPONEMENT REQUEST (THIRD) for SWEETGRASS ANNEXATION #UDC-17-00542
Dear Mr. Hammer,
Steil Surveying Services, on behalf of the owner, hereby requests that the above-described
Annexation (31I Reading) be postponed from the scheduled December 11 City Council meeting
(Postpone at December 5 Public Services Committee) in order to allow for the owner to continue work
with the City in finalizing Annexation Agreement(s) for a project of this unique size and scope.
PLEASE NOTE: The delay has been all on our end as the committee of stakeholders is reconciling
internal documents and Annexation Agreement language following recommendations and input from the
City / City Attorney’s office.
We anticipate delivery of the final Draft of the Annexation Agreement to the City Attorney’s Office by
Wednesday, December 6. We hope this gives the City sufficient time to review, edit, and subsequently
execute the Agreement with the Owner in order to finalize the Annexation approval at the December
26, regular City Council meeting (following Public Services Committee on December 19th).
Please contact me with any questions or concerns.
Thank you and best regards,
Casey L. Palma, MCP
Steil Surveying Services, LLC
CPalma@SteilSurvey.com
1102 WEST 19TH STREET
• P.O. BOX 2073
• CHEYENNE, WYOMING 82003
• 307/634-7273
```
